SUMMARY:Fiddleheads: Preschool Nature Explorers
DESCRIPTION:Ages: 4-5\nDate: Wednesdays\, September 30 – November 4 (6-sessions)\nTime: 1:30 PM – 4:00 PM\nFee: $172 ($154 Household & above Members) \nLet curiosity lead the way! In this playful\, nature-based drop-off program\, preschoolers will discover the wonders of the natural world through hands-on activities\, outdoor adventures\, seasonal crafts\, storytelling\, and play. Led by our youth education staff\, each week explores a new theme inspired by seasonal happenings in the Garden—designed to foster joyful connection with the natural world. A healthy snack is included. Group limited to 10. \nREGISTER HERE
